# Results and reports are provenance, not editable text.
#
# A run's "inputs digest" is a SHA-256 over the bytes of its result JSON. Git's
# line-ending conversion rewrites those bytes on checkout (on Windows, LF -> CRLF),
# so the same results produced a different digest after a clone, a worktree or a
# branch switch — while the measurements were identical. Keeping these paths
# byte-exact makes a digest mean what the reports claim it means.
studies/*/results/** -text
studies/*/reports/** -text
